  "main": "\n<main class=\"tsc-clinic\">\n\t<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"MedicalBusiness\",\"name\":\"The Schoeman Clinic, Virtual appointments\",\"description\":\"Specialist hormone, functional and longevity medicine consultations available online across the UK and internationally.\",\"url\":\"/clinic/virtual-appointments/\",\"telephone\":\"+44 20 3006 3224\",\"email\":\"info@theschoemanclinic.com\",\"image\":\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/clinic-virtual-appointments.webp\",\"availableService\":[{\"@type\":\"MedicalTherapy\",\"name\":\"Hormone health & optimisation\"},{\"@type\":\"MedicalTherapy\",\"name\":\"Longevity & functional medicine\"},{\"@type\":\"MedicalTherapy\",\"name\":\"Metabolic health\"},{\"@type\":\"MedicalTherapy\",\"name\":\"Digestive health\"},{\"@type\":\"MedicalTherapy\",\"name\":\"Diagnostics & supportive services\"}],\"areaServed\":[\"United Kingdom\",\"International\"]}</script>\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"FAQPage\",\"mainEntity\":[{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Do I need a GP referral?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"No. You may self-refer directly by phone, email or online enquiry. We recommend keeping your GP informed of specialist care to support continuity across your healthcare team.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Are pre-consultation blood tests required?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes. Blood testing before your first appointment gives your clinician meaningful data to review from the outset. We provide a test request and preparation guidance, and help you arrange testing near you.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Can my full care pathway be managed online?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes. Initial and follow-up consultations, repeat testing and prescription management can all be handled remotely where clinically and legally appropriate.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"How do I join my virtual consultation?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"You will receive a secure link and joining instructions before your appointment. No specialist software is required, only a device with a camera, microphone and stable internet connection.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Can I switch between virtual and in-person appointments?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes. You can move between virtual appointments and our Harley Street or Wimbledon clinics whenever your circumstances or clinical needs change.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Are international patients accepted?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"International patients are welcome to enquire. Please contact the team so we can confirm suitable arrangements for testing and prescribing in your location.\"}}]}</script>\n\n\n<section class=\"tsc-clinic__hero\">\n\t<div class=\"tsc-clinic__shell\">\n\t\t<nav class=\"tsc-clinic__crumb\" aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\" style=\"opacity: 1;transform: translateY(0px);transition:opacity 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.2,1) 0ms, transform 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.2,1) 0ms\">\n\t\t\t<a href=\"/\">The Practice</a>\n\t\t\t<span aria-hidden=\"true\">/</span>\n\t\t\t<span>Our Clinics</span>\n\t\t\t<span aria-hidden=\"true\">/</span>\n\t\t\t<strong>Virtual appointments</strong>\n\t\t</nav>\n\t\t<div class=\"tsc-clinic__hero-grid\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"tsc-clinic__hero-copy\">\n\t\t\t\t<h1 style=\"opacity: 1;transform: translateY(0px);transition:opacity 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.2,1) 140ms, transform 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.2,1) 140ms\">Virtual appointments</h1>\n\t\t\t\t<address style=\"opacity: 1;transform: translateY(0px);transition:opacity 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.2,1) 200ms, transform 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.2,1) 200ms\">\n\t\t\t\t\tSecure online consultations<br> Available across the United Kingdom<br> International patients welcomed\t\t\t\t</address>\n\t\t\t\t<p class=\"tsc-clinic__lede\" style=\"opacity: 1;transform: translateY(0px);transition:opacity 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.2,1) 260ms, transform 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.2,1) 260ms\">Specialist hormone, functional and longevity medicine from wherever you are, with the same clinical depth as an in-person consultation.</p>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"tsc-clinic__actions\" style=\"opacity: 1;transform: translateY(0px);transition:opacity 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.2,1) 320ms, transform 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.2,1) 320ms\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"btn-luxe\" href=\"/book/\">Book a virtual appointment</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"tsc-clinic__hero-image tsc-clinic__hero-image--virtual\" style=\"opacity: 1;transform: translateY(0px);transition:opacity 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.2,1) 160ms, transform 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.2,1) 160ms\">\n\t\t\t\t<img class=\"tsc-kenburns\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/clinic-virtual-appointments.webp\" alt=\"The Schoeman Clinic team reviewing patient information during a virtual consultation\" width=\"1024\" height=\"682\" loading=\"eager\" fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\">\n\t\t\t\t<span aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n</section>\n\n\n<section class=\"tsc-clinic__section\">\n\t<div class=\"tsc-clinic__shell tsc-clinic__detail-grid\">\n\t\t<div class=\"tsc-clinic__prose\" style=\"opacity: 1;transform: translateY(0px);transition:opacity 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.2,1) 0ms, transform 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.2,1) 0ms\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"eyebrow\">The clinic</div>\n\t\t\t<h2>Specialist care, wherever you are.</h2>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Virtual appointments are a fully integrated part of care at The Schoeman Clinic. They provide the same depth of clinical assessment, the same quality of prescribing and the same continuity of care as an appointment at Harley Street or Wimbledon.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Before your first consultation, blood testing is arranged at a suitable facility near you. Your clinician reviews the results in advance, takes a comprehensive clinical history during a secure video appointment and develops a personalised plan around your symptoms, results and goals.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Follow-up consultations, repeat testing and prescription management can all be handled remotely. Virtual care is available to adult patients of all genders across the United Kingdom, and international patients are welcome to contact the team to discuss testing and prescribing arrangements in their location.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t<aside class=\"tsc-clinic__info\" style=\"opacity: 1;transform: translateY(0px);transition:opacity 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.2,1) 140ms, transform 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.2,1) 140ms\">\n\t\t\t<section>\n\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"eyebrow\">Opening hours</h3>\n\t\t\t\t<dl class=\"tsc-clinic__hours\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div><dt>Monday – Friday</dt><dd>9:00 – 17:00 GMT</dd></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div><dt>Saturday – Sunday</dt><dd>Closed</dd></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</dl>\n\t\t\t</section>\n\t\t\t<section>\n\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"eyebrow\">How virtual care works</h3>\n\t\t\t\t<dl class=\"tsc-clinic__travel\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div><dt>Your appointment</dt><dd>Join through a secure link using a device with a camera, microphone and stable internet connection. No specialist software is required.</dd></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div><dt>Testing &amp; prescriptions</dt><dd>Blood testing is arranged near you. Prescriptions and ongoing monitoring are managed remotely wherever clinically and legally appropriate.</dd></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</dl>\n\t\t\t</section>\n\t\t\t<section>\n\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"eyebrow\">Contact</h3>\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"tel:+442030063224\">+44 (0)20 3006 3224</a>\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"mailto:info@theschoemanclinic.com\">info@theschoemanclinic.com</a>\n\t\t\t</section>\n\t\t</aside>\n\t</div>\n</section>\n\n\n<section class=\"tsc-clinic__services-band\">\n\t<div class=\"tsc-clinic__shell\">\n\t\t<div class=\"tsc-clinic__services-heading\" style=\"opacity: 1;transform: translateY(0px);transition:opacity 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.2,1) 0ms, transform 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.2,1) 0ms\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"eyebrow\">Services available online</div>\n\t\t\t<p>The clinic’s complete specialist service is available through secure online consultation.</p>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t<ul class=\"tsc-clinic__services\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li style=\"opacity: 1;transform: translateY(0px);transition:opacity 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.2,1) 0ms, transform 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.2,1) 0ms\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"/hormone-health/\">Hormone health &amp; optimisation</a>\n\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li style=\"opacity: 1;transform: translateY(0px);transition:opacity 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.2,1) 70ms, transform 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.2,1) 70ms\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"/longevity-functional/\">Longevity &amp; functional medicine</a>\n\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li style=\"opacity: 1;transform: translateY(0px);transition:opacity 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.2,1) 140ms, transform 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.2,1) 140ms\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"/metabolic-health/\">Metabolic health</a>\n\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li style=\"opacity: 1;transform: translateY(0px);transition:opacity 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.2,1) 210ms, transform 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.2,1) 210ms\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"/digestive-health/\">Digestive health</a>\n\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li style=\"opacity: 1;transform: translateY(0px);transition:opacity 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.2,1) 280ms, transform 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.2,1) 280ms\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"/diagnostics/\">Diagnostics &amp; supportive services</a>\n\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t</div>\n</section>\n\n\n<section class=\"tsc-clinic__section tsc-clinic__section--stone\">\n\t<div class=\"tsc-clinic__shell tsc-clinic__split-heading\">\n\t\t<div style=\"opacity: 1;transform: translateY(0px);transition:opacity 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.2,1) 0ms, transform 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.2,1) 0ms\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"eyebrow\">Designed around your life</div>\n\t\t\t<h2>Who virtual appointments suit</h2>\n\t\t\t<p>There is no lesser standard of care in choosing a virtual appointment. The format simply makes specialist care more accessible.</p>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t<ul class=\"tsc-clinic__suitability\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li style=\"opacity: 1;transform: translateY(0px);transition:opacity 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.2,1) 0ms, transform 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.2,1) 0ms\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<span aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3>Distance</h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>For patients outside London or unable to reach either clinic easily.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li style=\"opacity: 1;transform: translateY(0px);transition:opacity 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.2,1) 70ms, transform 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.2,1) 70ms\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<span aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3>Time</h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>For demanding schedules, caring responsibilities or limited energy.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li style=\"opacity: 1;transform: translateY(0px);transition:opacity 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.2,1) 140ms, transform 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.2,1) 140ms\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<span aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3>Comfort</h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>For those who prefer the privacy and convenience of consulting from home.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li style=\"opacity: 1;transform: translateY(0px);transition:opacity 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.2,1) 210ms, transform 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.2,1) 210ms\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<span aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3>Flexibility</h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>For patients combining online care with occasional in-person appointments.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t</div>\n</section>\n\n\n<section class=\"tsc-clinic__section tsc-clinic__section--stone\">\n\t<div class=\"tsc-clinic__shell tsc-clinic__split-heading\">\n\t\t<div style=\"opacity: 1;transform: translateY(0px);transition:opacity 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.2,1) 0ms, transform 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.2,1) 0ms\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"eyebrow\">How it works</div>\n\t\t\t<h2>Your patient journey</h2>\n\t\t\t<p>From first enquiry through to ongoing care, every step is designed to be clear, unhurried and focused on your outcomes.</p>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"tsc-clinic__journey tsc-clinic__journey--four\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<article style=\"opacity: 1;transform: translateY(0px);transition:opacity 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.2,1) 0ms, transform 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.2,1) 0ms\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<span>01</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3>Blood testing</h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t<p>Before your first appointment, we provide a test request and help you arrange blood testing at a suitable facility near you.</p>\n\t\t\t\t</article>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<article style=\"opacity: 1;transform: translateY(0px);transition:opacity 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.2,1) 90ms, transform 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.2,1) 90ms\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<span>02</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3>Secure consultation</h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t<p>Meet your clinician by secure video for an in-depth review of your results, symptoms, health history and goals.</p>\n\t\t\t\t</article>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<article style=\"opacity: 1;transform: translateY(0px);transition:opacity 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.2,1) 180ms, transform 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.2,1) 180ms\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<span>03</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3>Personalised plan</h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t<p>Receive a clear treatment plan covering prescribing, nutrition, lifestyle, further testing and follow-up where appropriate.</p>\n\t\t\t\t</article>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<article style=\"opacity: 1;transform: translateY(0px);transition:opacity 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.2,1) 270ms, transform 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.2,1) 270ms\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<span>04</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3>Ongoing virtual care</h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t<p>Follow-up appointments, repeat testing and prescription management continue remotely with support from the clinic team.</p>\n\t\t\t\t</article>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n</section>\n\n\n<section id=\"fees\" class=\"tsc-clinic__fees border-y\">\n\t<div class=\"mx-auto max-w-[1440px] px-6 py-20 md:px-12 md:py-28\">\n\t\t<div class=\"mx-auto max-w-3xl text-center\">\n\t\t\t<div style=\"opacity: 1;transform: translateY(0px);transition:opacity 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.2,1) 0ms, transform 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.2,1) 0ms\"><div class=\"eyebrow justify-center\">Learn</div></div>\n\t\t\t<div style=\"opacity: 1;transform: translateY(0px);transition:opacity 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.2,1) 100ms, transform 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.2,1) 100ms\"><h2 class=\"mt-5 font-serif text-[2rem] leading-[1.12] tracking-[-0.005em] md:text-[2.6rem]\">Virtual appointment fees</h2></div>\n\t\t\t<div style=\"opacity: 1;transform: translateY(0px);transition:opacity 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.2,1) 200ms, transform 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.2,1) 200ms\"><p class=\"mt-6 text-[1.02rem] leading-[1.75] text-[color:var(--muted-foreground)]\">The Schoeman Clinic operates as a self-pay private clinic. Hormone health and functional medicine consultations are not routinely covered by health insurance. Where we refer you for further specialist investigations, those referrals may attract reimbursement depending on your policy. Please contact your insurer directly to confirm your coverage. Fees are the same for in-person and online consultations.</p></div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"mx-auto mt-16 max-w-[1000px] border\" style=\"border-color:color-mix(in oklab, var(--bronze) 20%, transparent);background:var(--stone-warm);padding:clamp(2rem,4vw,3.5rem)\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"grid gap-12 md:grid-cols-2 md:gap-16\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div style=\"opacity: 1;transform: translateY(0px);transition:opacity 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.2,1) 0ms, transform 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.2,1) 0ms\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"eyebrow\">Initial consultations</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"mt-6\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"flex items-baseline justify-between gap-6 border-b py-5\" style=\"border-color:color-mix(in oklab, var(--bronze) 20%, transparent)\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"font-serif text-[1.3rem]\">Condensed initial consultation</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"mt-1 text-[0.72rem] uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-[color:var(--muted-foreground)]\">45 minutes</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"font-serif text-[1.4rem] text-[color:var(--bronze)]\">£350</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"flex items-baseline justify-between gap-6 border-b py-5\" style=\"border-color:color-mix(in oklab, var(--bronze) 20%, transparent)\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"font-serif text-[1.3rem]\">Standard initial consultation</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"mt-1 text-[0.72rem] uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-[color:var(--muted-foreground)]\">60 minutes</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"font-serif text-[1.4rem] text-[color:var(--bronze)]\">£500</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"flex items-baseline justify-between gap-6 border-b py-5\" style=\"border-color:color-mix(in oklab, var(--bronze) 20%, transparent)\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"font-serif text-[1.3rem]\">Deep dive initial consultation</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"font-serif text-[1.4rem] text-[color:var(--bronze)]\">£750</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div style=\"opacity: 1;transform: translateY(0px);transition:opacity 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.2,1) 100ms, transform 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.2,1) 100ms\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"eyebrow\">Follow-up consultations</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"mt-6\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"flex items-baseline justify-between gap-6 border-b py-5\" style=\"border-color:color-mix(in oklab, var(--bronze) 20%, transparent)\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"font-serif text-[1.3rem]\">Standard follow-up consultation</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"mt-1 text-[0.72rem] uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-[color:var(--muted-foreground)]\">30 minutes</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"font-serif text-[1.4rem] text-[color:var(--bronze)]\">£250</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"flex items-baseline justify-between gap-6 border-b py-5\" style=\"border-color:color-mix(in oklab, var(--bronze) 20%, transparent)\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"font-serif text-[1.3rem]\">Check-in follow-up consultation</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"mt-1 text-[0.72rem] uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-[color:var(--muted-foreground)]\">15 minutes</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"font-serif text-[1.4rem] text-[color:var(--bronze)]\">£125</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"mx-auto mt-14 max-w-[1000px] border-t pt-8 text-center\" style=\"border-color:color-mix(in oklab, var(--bronze) 20%, transparent)\">\n\t\t\t<p class=\"text-[0.95rem] leading-[1.85] text-[color:var(--muted-foreground)]\">Consultation fees do not include laboratory testing. Blood test costs vary according to the investigations selected and will be discussed at your initial consultation. Further information is available in our <a class=\"text-[color:var(--ink)] underline decoration-[color:var(--bronze)] underline-offset-4\" href=\"/faqs/\">FAQs</a>.</p>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"mt-10\"><a class=\"btn-luxe\" href=\"/book/\">Book an appointment</a></div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n</section>\n\n\n<section class=\"tsc-clinic__section\">\n\t<div class=\"tsc-clinic__shell tsc-clinic__split-heading\">\n\t\t<div style=\"opacity: 1;transform: translateY(0px);transition:opacity 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.2,1) 0ms, transform 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.2,1) 0ms\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"eyebrow\">Clinical standards</div>\n\t\t\t<h2>Regulated, accredited care</h2>\n\t\t\t<p>Virtual appointments follow the same clinical governance, patient-safety standards and professional protocols as in-person care.</p>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"tsc-clinic__accreditations\" style=\"opacity: 1;transform: translateY(0px);transition:opacity 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.2,1) 140ms, transform 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.2,1) 140ms\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"/wp-content/themes/schoeman-clinic/assets/logo-gmc.png\" alt=\"GMC Registered\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<span>GMC Registered</span>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"/wp-content/themes/schoeman-clinic/assets/logo-cqc.png\" alt=\"CQC Standards\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<span>CQC Standards</span>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"/wp-content/themes/schoeman-clinic/assets/logo-bma.svg\" alt=\"BMA\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<span>BMA</span>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"/wp-content/themes/schoeman-clinic/assets/logo-rcgp.avif\" alt=\"RCGP\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<span>RCGP</span>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"/wp-content/themes/schoeman-clinic/assets/logo-ifm.png\" alt=\"IFM\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<span>IFM</span>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"/wp-content/themes/schoeman-clinic/assets/logo-abhrt.avif\" alt=\"ABHRT\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<span>ABHRT</span>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n</section>\n\n\n<section class=\"tsc-clinic__section tsc-clinic__locations\">\n\t<div class=\"tsc-clinic__shell\">\n\t\t<header style=\"opacity: 1;transform: translateY(0px);transition:opacity 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.2,1) 0ms, transform 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.2,1) 0ms\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"eyebrow\">Our other locations</div>\n\t\t\t<h2>Visit us on Harley Street or in Wimbledon.</h2>\n\t\t</header>\n\t\t<div class=\"mt-16 grid gap-8 md:grid-cols-2 lg:gap-12\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<article style=\"opacity: 1;transform: translateY(0px);transition:opacity 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.2,1) 80ms, transform 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.2,1) 80ms\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"group flex h-full flex-col border border-[color:var(--border)] bg-background p-8 transition-all duration-700 hover:border-[color:var(--champagne)] hover:shadow-[0_24px_60px_color-mix(in_oklab,var(--foreground)_6%,transparent)] md:p-12\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"text-[0.65rem] uppercase tracking-[0.32em] text-[color:var(--bronze)]\">Harley Street · Central London</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"mt-4 font-serif text-2xl md:text-3xl\">Harley Street</h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<address class=\"mt-6 not-italic text-sm leading-[1.85] text-[color:var(--muted-foreground)]\">The Schoeman Clinic<br>96 Harley Street<br>London W1G 7HY</address>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"mt-7 text-sm leading-[1.85] text-[color:var(--muted-foreground)]\">Our primary in-person location in London’s established private medical quarter.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"mt-auto pt-10\"><a class=\"btn-ghost-luxe inline-flex w-full\" href=\"/clinic/harley-street/\">View Harley Street</a></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</article>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<article style=\"opacity: 1;transform: translateY(0px);transition:opacity 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.2,1) 160ms, transform 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.2,1) 160ms\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"group flex h-full flex-col border border-[color:var(--border)] bg-background p-8 transition-all duration-700 hover:border-[color:var(--champagne)] hover:shadow-[0_24px_60px_color-mix(in_oklab,var(--foreground)_6%,transparent)] md:p-12\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"text-[0.65rem] uppercase tracking-[0.32em] text-[color:var(--bronze)]\">Wimbledon · South West London</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"mt-4 font-serif text-2xl md:text-3xl\">Wimbledon</h3>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<address class=\"mt-6 not-italic text-sm leading-[1.85] text-[color:var(--muted-foreground)]\">The Schoeman Clinic<br>4 St Marks Place, Wimbledon<br>London SW19 7NP</address>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"mt-7 text-sm leading-[1.85] text-[color:var(--muted-foreground)]\">A quieter village setting offering the same specialist hormonal, metabolic and longevity care as Harley Street.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"mt-auto pt-10\"><a class=\"btn-ghost-luxe inline-flex w-full\" href=\"/clinic/wimbledon/\">View Wimbledon</a></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</article>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n</section>\n\n\n<section class=\"border-y bg-background\" style=\"border-color:color-mix(in oklab, var(--bronze) 18%, transparent)\">\n\t<div class=\"mx-auto max-w-[1440px] px-6 py-28 md:px-12 md:py-36\">\n\t\t<div class=\"tsc-faq\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"tsc-faq__aside\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"tsc-faq__sticky\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div style=\"opacity: 1;transform: translateY(0px);transition:opacity 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.2,1) 0ms, transform 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.2,1) 0ms\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 text-[0.62rem] font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.34em]\" style=\"color:var(--bronze)\">Frequently asked</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div style=\"opacity: 1;transform: translateY(0px);transition:opacity 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.2,1) 100ms, transform 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.2,1) 100ms\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"mt-6 font-serif text-[2rem] leading-[1.12] tracking-[-0.005em] md:text-[2.6rem]\" style=\"color:var(--ink)\">Your questions, <span class=\"italic font-normal\" style=\"color:color-mix(in oklab, var(--ink) 60%, transparent)\">answered.</span></h2>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div style=\"opacity: 1;transform: translateY(0px);transition:opacity 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.2,1) 200ms, transform 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.2,1) 200ms\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"tsc-faq__prompt\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"btn-ghost-luxe inline-flex\" href=\"/book/\">Book an appointment</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"tsc-faq__list\">\n\t\t\t\t<div data-accordion=\"\" style=\"opacity: 1;transform: translateY(0px);transition:opacity 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.2,1) 120ms, transform 1100ms cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.2,1) 120ms\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"group border-t\" style=\"border-color:color-mix(in oklab, var(--foreground) 12%, transparent)\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<button aria-expanded=\"true\" class=\"flex w-full items-start justify-between gap-8 py-7 text-left transition-colors hover:text-[color:var(--bronze)] md:py-8\" type=\"button\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"flex items-baseline gap-5\"><span class=\"font-serif text-[1.3rem] leading-[1.3] md:text-[1.6rem]\">Do I need a GP referral?</span></span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"relative mt-2 inline-block h-[14px] w-[14px] shrink-0\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"absolute left-0 top-1/2 block h-px w-full -translate-y-1/2\" style=\"background:var(--bronze)\"></span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"absolute left-1/2 top-0 block h-full w-px -translate-x-1/2 transition-transform duration-500\" style=\"background:var(--bronze);transform:scaleY(0)\"></span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</button>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grid overflow-hidden transition-[grid-template-rows] duration-500 ease-[cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.2,1)]\" style=\"grid-template-rows:1fr\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"min-h-0\"><div class=\"pb-8 pl-0 pr-10 text-[0.98rem] leading-[1.85] text-[color:var(--muted-foreground)] md:text-[1.02rem]\">No. You may self-refer directly by phone, email or online enquiry. We recommend keeping your GP informed of specialist care to support continuity across your healthcare team.</div></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"group border-t\" style=\"border-color:color-mix(in oklab, var(--foreground) 12%, transparent)\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<button aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"flex w-full items-start justify-between gap-8 py-7 text-left transition-colors hover:text-[color:var(--bronze)] md:py-8\" type=\"button\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"flex items-baseline gap-5\"><span class=\"font-serif text-[1.3rem] leading-[1.3] md:text-[1.6rem]\">Are pre-consultation blood tests required?</span></span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"relative mt-2 inline-block h-[14px] w-[14px] shrink-0\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"absolute left-0 top-1/2 block h-px w-full -translate-y-1/2\" style=\"background:var(--bronze)\"></span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"absolute left-1/2 top-0 block h-full w-px -translate-x-1/2 transition-transform duration-500\" style=\"background:var(--bronze);transform:scaleY(1)\"></span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</button>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grid overflow-hidden transition-[grid-template-rows] duration-500 ease-[cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.2,1)]\" style=\"grid-template-rows:0fr\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"min-h-0\"><div class=\"pb-8 pl-0 pr-10 text-[0.98rem] leading-[1.85] text-[color:var(--muted-foreground)] md:text-[1.02rem]\">Yes. Blood testing before your first appointment gives your clinician meaningful data to review from the outset. We provide a test request and preparation guidance, and help you arrange testing near you.</div></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"group border-t\" style=\"border-color:color-mix(in oklab, var(--foreground) 12%, transparent)\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<button aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"flex w-full items-start justify-between gap-8 py-7 text-left transition-colors hover:text-[color:var(--bronze)] md:py-8\" type=\"button\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"flex items-baseline gap-5\"><span class=\"font-serif text-[1.3rem] leading-[1.3] md:text-[1.6rem]\">Can my full care pathway be managed online?</span></span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"relative mt-2 inline-block h-[14px] w-[14px] shrink-0\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"absolute left-0 top-1/2 block h-px w-full -translate-y-1/2\" style=\"background:var(--bronze)\"></span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"absolute left-1/2 top-0 block h-full w-px -translate-x-1/2 transition-transform duration-500\" style=\"background:var(--bronze);transform:scaleY(1)\"></span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</button>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grid overflow-hidden transition-[grid-template-rows] duration-500 ease-[cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.2,1)]\" style=\"grid-template-rows:0fr\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"min-h-0\"><div class=\"pb-8 pl-0 pr-10 text-[0.98rem] leading-[1.85] text-[color:var(--muted-foreground)] md:text-[1.02rem]\">Yes. Initial and follow-up consultations, repeat testing and prescription management can all be handled remotely where clinically and legally appropriate.</div></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"group border-t\" style=\"border-color:color-mix(in oklab, var(--foreground) 12%, transparent)\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<button aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"flex w-full items-start justify-between gap-8 py-7 text-left transition-colors hover:text-[color:var(--bronze)] md:py-8\" type=\"button\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"flex items-baseline gap-5\"><span class=\"font-serif text-[1.3rem] leading-[1.3] md:text-[1.6rem]\">How do I join my virtual consultation?</span></span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"relative mt-2 inline-block h-[14px] w-[14px] shrink-0\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"absolute left-0 top-1/2 block h-px w-full -translate-y-1/2\" style=\"background:var(--bronze)\"></span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"absolute left-1/2 top-0 block h-full w-px -translate-x-1/2 transition-transform duration-500\" style=\"background:var(--bronze);transform:scaleY(1)\"></span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</button>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grid overflow-hidden transition-[grid-template-rows] duration-500 ease-[cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.2,1)]\" style=\"grid-template-rows:0fr\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"min-h-0\"><div class=\"pb-8 pl-0 pr-10 text-[0.98rem] leading-[1.85] text-[color:var(--muted-foreground)] md:text-[1.02rem]\">You will receive a secure link and joining instructions before your appointment. No specialist software is required, only a device with a camera, microphone and stable internet connection.</div></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"group border-t\" style=\"border-color:color-mix(in oklab, var(--foreground) 12%, transparent)\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<button aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"flex w-full items-start justify-between gap-8 py-7 text-left transition-colors hover:text-[color:var(--bronze)] md:py-8\" type=\"button\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"flex items-baseline gap-5\"><span class=\"font-serif text-[1.3rem] leading-[1.3] md:text-[1.6rem]\">Can I switch between virtual and in-person appointments?</span></span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"relative mt-2 inline-block h-[14px] w-[14px] shrink-0\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"absolute left-0 top-1/2 block h-px w-full -translate-y-1/2\" style=\"background:var(--bronze)\"></span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"absolute left-1/2 top-0 block h-full w-px -translate-x-1/2 transition-transform duration-500\" style=\"background:var(--bronze);transform:scaleY(1)\"></span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</button>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grid overflow-hidden transition-[grid-template-rows] duration-500 ease-[cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.2,1)]\" style=\"grid-template-rows:0fr\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"min-h-0\"><div class=\"pb-8 pl-0 pr-10 text-[0.98rem] leading-[1.85] text-[color:var(--muted-foreground)] md:text-[1.02rem]\">Yes. You can move between virtual appointments and our Harley Street or Wimbledon clinics whenever your circumstances or clinical needs change.</div></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"group border-t\" style=\"border-color:color-mix(in oklab, var(--foreground) 12%, transparent)\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<button aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"flex w-full items-start justify-between gap-8 py-7 text-left transition-colors hover:text-[color:var(--bronze)] md:py-8\" type=\"button\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"flex items-baseline gap-5\"><span class=\"font-serif text-[1.3rem] leading-[1.3] md:text-[1.6rem]\">Are international patients accepted?</span></span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"relative mt-2 inline-block h-[14px] w-[14px] shrink-0\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"absolute left-0 top-1/2 block h-px w-full -translate-y-1/2\" style=\"background:var(--bronze)\"></span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"absolute left-1/2 top-0 block h-full w-px -translate-x-1/2 transition-transform duration-500\" style=\"background:var(--bronze);transform:scaleY(1)\"></span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</button>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"grid overflow-hidden transition-[grid-template-rows] duration-500 ease-[cubic-bezier(0.2,0.7,0.2,1)]\" style=\"grid-template-rows:0fr\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"min-h-0\"><div class=\"pb-8 pl-0 pr-10 text-[0.98rem] leading-[1.85] text-[color:var(--muted-foreground)] md:text-[1.02rem]\">International patients are welcome to enquire. Please contact the team so we can confirm suitable arrangements for testing and prescribing in your location.</div></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"border-t\" style=\"border-color:color-mix(in oklab, var(--foreground) 12%, transparent)\"></div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n</section>\n</main>\n\t"
}
